THE DESCRIPTION OF ACTIVITIES RELATED TO THE TERMINATION OF EMPLOYMENT RELATIONSHIP


After the termination of the employment relationship, a work certificate is issued immediately.

Personal files are archived at the registered office of The Company. The e-mail account is deactivated, the access card is reprogrammed, data from the time recorder is deleted.


§ 21.

