work certificates,

diplomas,

other certificates.

Statements about family members subject to insurance applications

Medical certificate on the absence of contraindications to the work performed

Declaration on disability, affiliation to the NFZ branch, on subject to the Tax Office, on the willingness to exercise the right to care for a child, on familiarizing themselves with health and safety regulations, internal regulations.

Documents are completed in the administration department of the Company. After completing them, they are delivered to the HR department of the external HR company. In the human resources department, personal files are created and kept in paper form. Personal files are stored in the armored cabinet.


§ 22.

